# Stale AGP outputs that used to sit next to the module (not app/build/).
# Distribute and build-*.sh write under app/build/outputs/, which build/ already ignores.
# There is no baseline-prof.txt source in this repo; the .dm files were release artifacts.
app/debug/
app/release/
*.apk
*.aab
*.dm
*.log
*_log.txt
